  "semantics": "Static syntax census only. Count an exact raw literal input only when the same parser result has a direct positive name equality to a nonempty literal title. ParserInternal/ParserGuessit fixture parametrization does not multiply input capacity. name= configuration alone, validity, episode IDs and quality equalities do not prove title identity. Constructed strings, nested quality loops and Cartesian expansions are excluded. Assertions are copied from upstream code without executing any upstream module or the PulseMedia parser; unasserted fields are not filled from input tokens. Lexical quality.name is preserved verbatim and is not a measured media fact. Full canonical coverage, confidence and rationale remain unreviewed. Real-release provenance must be independently established before a work-named fixture can count as independent real-release gold.",
